step Receive gradient profile for temporary speed restriction
sub Sub-step1
telegram balise Q_UPDOWN=1 M_VERSION=32 Q_MEDIA=0 N_PIG=1 N_TOTAL=1 M_DUP=0 M_MCOUNT=4 NID_C=140 NID_BG=2124 Q_LINK=0 | DEFAULT_GRADIENT_FOR_TEMPORARY_SPEED_RESTRICTION NID_PACKET=141 Q_DIR=1 L_PACKET=400 Q_GDIR=0 G_TSR=30
